:: stage2-fullScreenChat-messages-eng [nobr]
<<timed 0.1s>>
    <<append "#chatHistory">>
         <div class="message-received">
        <span>Oh that’s amazing.</span>
        </div>
        <</append>>
    <</timed>>

<<timed 2s>>
    <<append "#chatHistory">>
         <div class="message-received">
        <span>I want us to understand what the BFG is asking for us to do. </span>
        </div>
        <</append>>
    <</timed>>

<<timed 4s>>
    <<append "#chatHistory">>
         <div class="message-received">
        <span>Before we share our Dreams - we need to understand what Dreams are. 
</span>
        </div>
        <</append>>
    <</timed>>

<<timed 6s>>
    <<append "#chatHistory">>
         <div class="message-received">
        <span>
Let’s start with how the BFG holds onto Dreams. 
</span>
        </div>
        <</append>>
    <</timed>>
<<timed 8s>>
    <<append "#chatHistory">>
         <div class="message-received">
        <span>
Dream Jars. 
</span>
        </div>
        <</append>>
    <</timed>>
<br/><br/>
<<timed 11s>>
    <<append "#chatHistory">>
         <div class="message-received">
        <span>
I’ve sent over some templates we have here in the Library portal or you can use real jars if you’d like.
</span>
        </div>
        <</append>>
    <</timed>>

<<timed 13s>>
    <<append "#chatHistory">>
         <div class="message-received">
        <span>
Once you have them ready I have some quotes from the BFG about Dream Jars to inspire your design. 
</span>
        </div>
        <</append>>
    <</timed>>

<<timed 15s>>
    <<append "#chatHistory">>
         <div class="message-received">
        <span>
Just message me the word JAR and I’ll send over the quotes. 
</span>
        </div>
        <</append>>
    <</timed>>


